<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        <span class="header">DO NOT STAPLE OR FOLD</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 85%; text-align: right;">
        <span class="header">For Official Use Only ►</span>
        <br>
        OMB No. <span data-field="omb_number">{{ omb_number }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        Kind of Payer (Check one)
        <br>
        <input type="checkbox"> Military
        <input type="checkbox"> State/local
        <input type="checkbox"> Federal govt.
        <input type="checkbox"> Other
      </td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        Kind (Check one)
        <br>
        <input type="checkbox"> Employer
        <input type="checkbox"> Employee
      </td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        <span class="header">State/local non-501c</span>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span class="header">State/local 501c</span>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span class="header">Federal govt.</span>
        <input type="checkbox">
      </td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        <span class="header">Non-govt.</span>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span class="header">Third-party sick pay</span>
        <input type="checkbox">
      </td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">
        <span class="header">Total number of Forms W-2</span>
        <span data-field="total_forms_w2">{{ total_forms_w2 }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Employer identification number (EIN)</span>
        <span data-field="ein">{{ ein }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Social security wages</span>
        <span data-field="social_security_wages">{{ social_security_wages }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Social security tax withheld</span>
        <span data-field="ss_tax_withheld">{{ ss_tax_withheld }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Employer's name</span>
        <span data-field="employer_name">{{ employer_name }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Medicare wages and tips</span>
        <span data-field="medicare_wages">{{ medicare_wages }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Medicare tax withheld</span>
        <span data-field="medicare_tax_withheld">{{ medicare_tax_withheld }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Employer's address and ZIP code</span>
        <span data-field="employer_address">{{ employer_address }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Total security tips</span>
        <span data-field="total_security_tips">{{ total_security_tips }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header"></span>
        <span data-field="empty_field_10">{{ empty_field_10 }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Other EIN used this year</span>
        <span data-field="other_ein">{{ other_ein }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Nonqualified plans</span>
        <span data-field="nonqualified_plans">{{ nonqualified_plans }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Deferred compensation</span>
        <span data-field="deferred_compensation">{{ deferred_compensation }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Employer's territorial ID number</span>
        <span data-field="territorial_id">{{ territorial_id }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header">Income tax withheld by payer of third-party sick pay</span>
        <span data-field="income_tax_third_party_sick_pay">{{ income_tax_third_party_sick_pay }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="header"></span>
        <span data-field="empty_field_12b">{{ empty_field_12b }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        Contact person
        <br>
        Email address
        <br>
        Fax number
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        Telephone number
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        For Official Use Only
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this return and accompanying documents, and, to the best of my knowledge and belief, they are true, correct, and complete.</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Signature ►</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Title ►</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Date ►</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <span class="header">Form W-3SS Transmittal of Wage and Tax Statements</span>
    <br>
    <span class="header">2011</span>
    <br>
    Department of the Treasury
    <br>
    Internal Revenue Service
  </div>
  <p>Send this entire page with the entire Copy A page of Form(s) W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, or W-2VI to the Social Security Administration (SSA). Photocopies are not acceptable.</p>
  <p>Do not send any remittance (cash, checks, money orders, etc.) with Forms W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, W-2VI, and W-3SS.</p>
  <p><strong>Reminders</strong></p>
  <p>Separate instructions. See the 2011 Instructions for Forms W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, W-2VI, and W-3SS for information on completing this form.</p>
  <p><strong>Purpose of Form</strong></p>
  <p>Use Form W-3SS to transmit paper Copy A of Forms W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, and W-2VI. Make a copy of Form W-3SS and keep it with Copy D. Send the original Form W-3SS to the SSA. Use Form W-3SS for the correct year. File Form W-3SS even if only one Form W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, or W-2VI is being filed, or if no wages and tax information electronically do not file Form W-3SS.</p>
  <p><strong>When To File</strong></p>
  <p>Mail Copy A of Form(s) W-3SS with a Copy A of Form(s) W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, or W-2VI by February 29, 2012.</p>
  <p><strong>Where To File</strong></p>
  <p>Send this entire page with the entire Copy A page of Form(s) W-2AS, W-2CM, W-2GU, or W-2VI to:</p>
  <p>Social Security Administration</p>
  <p>Data Operations Center</p>
  <p>Wilkes-Barre, PA 18769-0001</p>
  <p>For Privacy Act and Paperwork Reduction Act Notice, see separate instructions.</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Cat. No. 101175</p>
</div>